From: Aliaksei Ivanou <aliaksei.ivanou@innowise.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 09:47:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Cover fatal reporters and debugger breaks with retries

RetryFailed::Fatal now compares the fatal-path output of every built-in reporter with and without --retry-failed, runs serially, and allows 120 seconds per crashing child. RetryFailed::DebugBreak builds against the amalgamated sources with a recording CATCH_BREAK_INTO_DEBUGGER and checks that --break reaches every failed assertion of every attempt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
